{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833","id":18906590,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxODkwNjU5MA==","number":3833,"title":"Arc / Ellipse anticlockwise","user":{"login":"em","id":337595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzU5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/337595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/em","html_url":"https://github.com/em","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/em/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2013-09-03T12:59:58Z","updated_at":"2015-09-03T04:52:13Z","closed_at":"2015-09-03T04:52:13Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The aClockwise option in arc / absarc / absellipse on THREE.Path has some strange behavior.\n\nHere's a test that plots the curve on a canvas context:\n\n```\nfunction test(ctx) {\n  var path = new THREE.Path();\n\n  path.absarc( 100,    // x\n               100,    // y\n               50,     // radius\n               2,      // start\n               6,      // end\n               false);  // anti-clockwise\n\n  var pts = path.getSpacedPoints();\n\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    ctx.lineTo(p.x, p.y);\n  });\n\n  ctx.stroke();\n}\n```\n\nThis produces: https://cloudup.com/cqjdrH4C1T8\n\nChanging anti-clockwise to true produces the exact same ellipse instead of following the other path of the circle to the same destination.\n\nIt also has some strange effects when you introduce other actions into the path.\n\nIf I add a lineTo after absarc:\n\n```\nfunction test(ctx) {\n  var path = new THREE.Path();\n\n  path.absarc( 100,    // x\n               100,    // y\n               50,     // radius\n               2,      // start\n               6,      // end\n               false);  // anti-clockwise\n\n  path.lineTo(100, 50);\n\n  var pts = path.getSpacedPoints();\n\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    ctx.lineTo(p.x, p.y);\n  });\n\n  ctx.stroke();\n}\n```\n\nI get https://cloudup.com/c8yYMvgAx3T\n\nand if I change anti-clockwise to true: https://cloudup.com/cinzkh2Oj75\n","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/3833/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}